message: If you use these data, please cite this release by its date.
title: The Magonia Cadastre
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  A dated register of sources: where accounts of unusual experiences are kept, and the weather, sky and earth records
  that help place and date them, each with its access and its terms of use. This release lists 39,661 sources.
